OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on borrowing
OL,4,Acosts at his first Prime Minister's
OL,5,AQuestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe cost of borrowing nudged higher
OL,8,Fearlier, reaching a new 18-year high -
OL,9,Fafter rising sharply in recent weeks
OL,11,FThe UK is already forecast to pay
OL,12,F#135bn on debt interest in 2026/27 -
OL,13,Fthat's 50% more than on defence. See
OL,14,Fthe breakdown here
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
