OL,3,AFour in court over murder of baby
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have been charged with murder,
OL,7,Fcausing or allowing the death of a
OL,8,Fchild and perverting the course of
OL,9,Fjustice by taking steps to conceal the
OL,10,Fkilling of an infant.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
