OL,3,AUS sailors arrive in Thailand's Pattaya
OL,4,Aafter record 250 days at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a record 250 days at sea without
OL,7,Fa port stop, the nuclear-powered
OL,8,Faircraft carrier USS Abraham Lincoln
OL,9,Fhas docked in Thailand, giving its
OL,10,Fnearly 5,000 crew members a much-needed
OL,11,Fbreak.
OL,13,FThe ship is docking close to the beach
OL,14,Fresort of Pattaya, known for its
OL,15,Fraucous nightlife and for sex tourism.
OL,16,FFor the US it also carries strong
OL,17,Fhistorical echoes.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
