OL,3,AUS sailors arrive in Thailand's Pattaya
OL,4,Aafter record 250 days at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the weary sailors walk into the
OL,7,Fcity's bars and restaurants, they will
OL,8,Fbe treading in the footsteps of the
OL,9,Fhundreds of thousands of US troops who
OL,10,Fcame here for R&R ` rest and relaxation
OL,11,F- during the Vietnam War.
OL,13,FThey transformed it from a sleepy
OL,14,Ffishing village to one of the world's
OL,15,Fmost famous and frenetic party towns.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
